WEBVTT

00:08:59.743 --> 00:09:03.581
we only need to subscribe once,
not once per platform.

00:09:04.248 --> 00:09:05.624
That' a big deal.

00:09:06.292 --> 00:09:08.002
And even more important,

00:09:08.002 --> 00:09:11.213
if we build these membership cards
on a blockchain,

00:09:12.047 --> 00:09:15.134
no company can ever take
Lisa's community away from her.

00:09:16.635 --> 00:09:19.888
Instagram could -- poof! --
disappear tomorrow

00:09:19.888 --> 00:09:22.891
and she would maintain her relationship
with her subscribers,

00:09:22.891 --> 00:09:25.185
and she would maintain her income.

00:09:27.146 --> 00:09:29.148
We can take this idea further.

00:09:29.857 --> 00:09:31.066
As we look to the future,